{"articleNo":"151061","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=151061&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[서울시립강북청소년수련관] 제2기 한국-몽골 글로벌 문화봉사단 단원모집 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2016.05.12","hit":"2184","attachments":[{"name":"제2기 한국-몽골 글로벌 문화봉사단 신청서류.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=151061&attachNo=75837"},{"name":"제2기 한국-몽골 글로벌문화봉사단 요약서.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=151061&attachNo=76211"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<!--StartFragment--><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; MARGIN-RIGHT: 5pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체\">1. 서울특별시립강북청소년</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">수련관은 서울특별시로부터 광운대학교에서 위탁받아 운영하는 청소년시설로서 국가 간의 다양한 교류를 통하여 공동체의식을 함양하기 위한 글로벌 문화봉사단 사업을 진행해 왔습니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; MARGIN-RIGHT: 5pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체\">2. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">제 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체\">2</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">기 한국</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체\">-</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">몽골 글로벌 문화봉사단은 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">기존 단순 노력봉사에서 벗어나 현지 대학생들과 연계하여 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">교류 프로그램</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">연합봉사단 구성 및 미션활동 등</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체\">), </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">현지 학교의 아동 및 청소년들 대상의 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">교육 프로그램</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">한글교육</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">공예품 만들기</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">한국문화교육 등</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체\">), </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">문화교류프로그램</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">한류댄스</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">전통예술 시연 등</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체\">)</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">에 초점을 맞추어 기획하였으니 참고 바랍니다.</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
